{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12124","headline":"广德初銮驾出关後登高愁望二首 二 · 钱起","name":"广德初銮驾出关後登高愁望二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愁看秦川色，惨惨云景晦。\n乾坤暂运行，品物遗覆载。\n黄尘涨戎马，紫气随龙斾。\n掩泣指关东，日月妖氛外。\n臣心寄远水，朝海去如带。\n周德更休明，天衢伫开泰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}